a "card" is a view where:
	- its "face" is up or down
	- to turn it over:
		- undone as "Turn Card"
		if its face is up
			set its face to down
		otherwise
			set its face to up
	- to draw it:
		<ui-button context-menu="game menu">{its face}</ui-button>

patience is an app where:
	- its "card" is a new card
	- to deal:
		- shortcut meta+D
		- undone as "Deal"
		turn its card over
	- its "game menu" is a menu of "deal", "-", "undo" and "redo"
	- its menu bar is "game menu"
	- to draw it:
		draw its card
